      "summary": "Chloe Worthy 與 Taanthip Tuchinda 以 ZBrush、Substance 3D Painter 和 Blender 重製漫畫封面，透過 Grease Pencil、視角變形與角色動畫保留平面構圖特徵。",
      "quick_impact": "★★★★☆",
      "source_url": "https://80.lv/articles/these-2d-characters-from-popular-manga-are-made-in-3d-with-blender",
      "category": "blender-dcc",
      "subcategory": "blender",
